#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:1 1a33edeb3d6d4272a161d433b810b6ee
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:3 5169f371090148d7a49aee9c45306e0d
msgid "What is InnoClaw?"
msgstr "什么是 InnoClaw？"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:5 525001ab37ed40b79555b94ac23b1dfc
msgid ""
"InnoClaw is an AI-powered research assistant web application similar to "
"Google NotebookLM. It lets you open server-side folders as "
"**workspaces**, browse and manage files, and chat with AI grounded in "
"your workspace files via **RAG** (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)."
msgstr ""
"InnoClaw 是一个类似于 Google NotebookLM 的 AI 驱动的研究助手 Web "
"应用程序。它允许您将服务器端文件夹作为**工作空间**打开，浏览和管理文件，并通过 **RAG**（检索增强生成）与基于工作空间文件的 AI "
"进行对话。"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:7 c87a9f29773145e8818ab0d5c4180df0
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr "核心功能"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:9 9af1a4501879478a9256a4e96afacbb4
msgid "**Workspace Management** — Map server folders as persistent workspaces"
msgstr "**工作空间管理** —— 将服务器文件夹映射为持久化工作空间"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:10 3a34c48a51c34654bdbb9a3b595a4068
msgid "**File Browser** — Tree view with upload, create, edit, rename, and delete"
msgstr "**文件浏览器** —— 树形视图，支持上传、创建、编辑、重命名和删除"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:11 0a02a35ae62b4deeb3f9d1fd651b79b7
msgid ""
"**GitHub Integration** — Clone and pull GitHub repositories (including "
"private ones)"
msgstr "**GitHub 集成** —— 克隆和拉取 GitHub 仓库（包括私有仓库）"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:12 f9213267e7394db2a6f0797a854da3ec
msgid ""
"**RAG Chat** — AI answers questions based on workspace file content with "
"source citations"
msgstr "**RAG 对话** —— AI 基于工作空间文件内容回答问题，并附带来源引用"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:13 749410dbf1fc481eb8c5350492919a33
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Note Generation** — Auto-generate summaries, FAQs, briefs, timelines, "
"and daily/weekly reports"
msgstr "**笔记生成** —— 自动生成摘要、常见问题、简报和时间线"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:14 2408a2a5fc244e1f82af5af548f630f0
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Multi-LLM Support** — Switch between OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, and "
"Google Gemini"
msgstr "**多 LLM 支持** —— 在 OpenAI GPT 和 Anthropic Claude 之间切换"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:15 48c8c390f9c94fb795b1b474912af5c1
msgid "**Bilingual UI** — Chinese / English toggle"
msgstr "**双语界面** —— 中文 / 英文切换"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:16 bdff42889adc4d1c96a408b8bd71c91a
msgid "**Dark Mode** — Light and dark theme support"
msgstr "**暗色模式** —— 支持浅色和深色主题"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:17 bb386140ab5b47daad4835a5d1df15a5
msgid "**Bot Integrations** — Feishu (Lark) and WeChat Enterprise bot support"
msgstr "**机器人集成** —— 支持飞书和企业微信机器人"

#: ../../getting-started/overview.md:18 d434aafac9b540bd8a4c94e84df9491e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Agent Mode** — Autonomous AI agent with tool usage (bash, file "
